VERDICT
   25b-03 CONFIRMED and NARROWED by reading, no budget owed. The forty ARE readable — fifteen lead-ins in
   §28.7.4 and twenty-five entry bodies at Register 165-189 — so DEF-138's owed reading is DONE, and the
   token probe it warned about is not what closed it. §30.3's share of the forty is 33 of 40 (upper bound 35);
   with the seventeen of 123-139 that is 50 (upper bound 52), against E.8's *Sixty-odd*. NO convention that
   respects *alone* reaches either band: the strict band is reached only by 62, which hands §30.3 both
   §32.2's shared block and §30.4's five, and the loose band only by 57, which hands it the shared block
   entire. The defective word is *alone*: §30.3's own share of the record is 50. 25b-03 stands as recorded,
   now on a reading of all forty rather than an arithmetic of two headings (DEF-138 item 6 DISCHARGED).
   New this unit: 25b-07 (§28.7 *two printed here*, six printed), 25b-08 (§28.7.3 *Seventy-five … all printed*,
